  "note": "Register numbers are hex and sent unchanged: the 03H example reads start address 00 F2 (frequency command monitor) and gets 1770H. Parameters use the register table in section 6 (e.g. F01 = 0001H, C00 = 0064H), which is not sequential."
 },
